---
source: tests/cli_golden.rs
expression: help
---
Sign in to zOS, or link a Claude / ChatGPT plan

Usage: aura login [OPTIONS] [PROVIDER]

Arguments:
  [PROVIDER]
          `zos` (default) for cloud models via aura-router, or `claude` / `chatgpt` to use your own plan directly
          
          [default: zos]

Options:
      --mode <MODE>
          Session mode for the interactive terminal. Overrides the daemon default (`AURA_DEFAULT_MODE`); the kernel denies any tool call the mode does not allow

          Possible values:
          - agent: Full unrestricted operation subject to user permissions
          - plan:  Read + markdown writes + read-only subprocesses
          - ask:   Read-only
          - debug: Read + sandboxed probes only

      --paste
          Paste the code shown by the provider instead of using a local browser redirect (for SSH and headless machines)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
